      "writtenOn": "2021-03-08T16:17:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately yes.\n\nIt uses it because it needs to receive CONNECTIVITY_ACTION broadcasts in order to work correctly, and you only get CONNECTIVITY_ACTION broadcasts for things like DUN and HIPRI if you register a legacy-type-containing request for them.\n\nThrowing in this method causes 14/206 tests in TetheringTests to fail.",
      "parentUuid": "8ab05853_08618455",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 157,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 160,
        "endChar": 75
      },
      "revId": "564d32da3561f57d5431945116fbb5555729ebfa",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
