      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but this code will send one broadcast for each request for that type (and in some undefined order at that, courtesy of HashMap iteration), so it sounds like it relies on either only one request per type being registered or the code being happy receiving multiple of these broadcasts in succession – which is kind of fine, but hopefully unrealistic.\n\nDo you want to have a set of legacy types and send the broadcasts only once ?",
